+### tmux-play-229
+
+When `callPlayer` receives `cwd`, `outputSchema`, `allowedTools`, an invocation cancellation signal, local attachments and an `onEvent` observer, the runtime shall forward the execution inputs to that invocation only and await the observer after durable event dispatch, leaving subsequent calls without inherited execution overrides.
+
